{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/887a15a3bc8e95a83525b7d7f8679434.poster.avif?t=1771841330\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/887a15a3bc8e95a83525b7d7f8679434.webm?t=1771841330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/aeab1e7b8d75c423030719cdb30625be.avif?t=1771841330\" width=616 height=130 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/40377ac21c8ed952668b0a2aa7f2fea1.webp?t=1771841330\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/40377ac21c8ed952668b0a2aa7f2fea1.poster.avif?t=1771841330\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=130 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the crew of Railpunk Mayhem, destroy enemies in your path using your train's tools and complete the journey as quickly as possible.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/05db6cf36bfa0e9c357696d949240a9f.poster.avif?t=1771841330\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/05db6cf36bfa0e9c357696d949240a9f.webm?t=1771841330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/90416ab171a66e1bc6d6ec69a986dcff.avif?t=1771841330\" width=616 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a multitude of wagons, each with upgrade branches and unique features that will aid you on your journey. <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/d649a950373b52566cecb4d1b628fbff.poster.avif?t=1771841330\" width=616 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/d649a950373b52566cecb4d1b628fbff.webm?t=1771841330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/4f722f817f6568d229aa94af9ddf4003.avif?t=1771841330\" width=616 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come across a variety of mercenaries throughout your journey, each one ready to join your crew. Every crew member brings their own set of unique strengths, adding diversity to your build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/f384a76d291b7b833b794ac1f307d6de.apng?t=1771841330\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/f384a76d291b7b833b794ac1f307d6de.poster.avif?t=1771841330\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=74 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/c73d6eb0be41797df7325f0aa2c89702.avif?t=1771841330\" width=616 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek out artifacts\u2014powerful upgrades that will enhance your crew and your train.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/b1e8b5faecbe04a25a8bfb916c60d367.poster.avif?t=1771841330\" width=616 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/b1e8b5faecbe04a25a8bfb916c60d367.webm?t=1771841330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/0aef529c099ef83c0f15750e8b9ed2f0.avif?t=1771841330\" width=616 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully choose your path\u2014the cities you visit will provide assistance that can make a significant difference. <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/7cde060699a2db155c224c38bf59831f.poster.avif?t=1771841330\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/7cde060699a2db155c224c38bf59831f.webm?t=1771841330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2874350?t=1771841330","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2874350?t=1771841330","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/2bf7e6e9bf1e02c53e32da0ba5cb1e8a9971e416/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771841330","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/2bf7e6e9bf1e02c53e32da0ba5cb1e8a9971e416/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771841330","categories":[{"